---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Content from '@layouts/partials/Content.astro';
import PageHeader from '@components/Ui/Components/PageHeader.vue';
const pageTitle = 'About Us';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle}>
    <PageHeader title={pageTitle} />
    <Content>
        <section class="my-20 space-y-10 lg:ml-20">
            <h2 class="max-w-lg">
                While the industry clings to outdated methods, Proline is
                forging a better way forward.
            </h2>

            <p class="max-w-lg md:ml-20 lg:ml-40">
                Our team thrives on innovation, constantly refining our systems
                to achieve smarter, more effective solutions. By consolidating
                every stage of your project under one roof, we eliminate
                inefficiencies, reduce costs, and streamline timelines. With our
                in-house fabrication capabilities, and transportation, there’s
                no need to juggle multiple vendors or worry about
                miscommunication across teams. Combining custom craftsmanship
                with a high-performance culture, Proline delivers innovative
                solutions that overcome any roadblocks. Our commitment to
                precision and adaptability ensures every project is executed
                seamlessly, no matter how complex the challenge.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="grid gap-x-5 gap-y-10 py-20 md:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="space-y-10">
                <img
                    src="/assets/about-us/metal-cladding.jpg"
                    alt=""
                    class="w-full"
                />
                <div class="space-y-5">
                    <h3 class="text-white">Metal Cladding</h3>
                    <div class="border-b border-proline-red"></div>
                    <p>
                        Masters in metal cladding installation, we deliver
                        durable, high-quality solutions tailored to projects of
                        any scale. From cutting-edge architectural designs to
                        large commercial developments, our expert team ensures
                        precision and excellence every step of the way.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-10">
                <img src="/assets/about-us/facades.jpg" alt="" class="w-full" />
                <div class="space-y-5">
                    <h3 class="text-white">Proline Facades</h3>
                    <div class="border-b border-proline-red"></div>
                    <p>
                        Redefining facade systems with innovative designs that
                        balance form and function, we create visually stunning
                        exteriors built for durability and performance. Our
                        facades elevate structures with unmatched style and
                        long-lasting value.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-10">
                <img
                    src="/assets/about-us/fabrication.jpg"
                    alt=""
                    class="w-full"
                />
                <div class="space-y-5">
                    <h3 class="text-white">Proline Fabrication</h3>
                    <div class="border-b border-proline-red"></div>
                    <p>
                        With cutting-edge technology (including state of the art
                        folders, CNC machines, break presses and guillotines)
                        combined with expert craftsmanship, our fabrication
                        division transforms designs into reality. From custom
                        flashings to large-scale production, Proline Fabrication
                        sets the standard for precision and manufacturing
                        excellence.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-20">
            <div class="mb-10 grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="space-y-10 md:my-10">
                    <h3>About the team</h3>
                    <h2>
                        With over 100 highly skilled professionals on-site and
                        off-site, Proline Group brings together master
                        craftsmen, agile problem solvers, and progressive
                        thinkers who always find better ways of doing things.
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <div class="relative h-full">
                    <img
                        src="/assets/about-us/about-the-team.jpg"
                        alt=""
                        class="h-full w-full object-cover md:absolute"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- <div
                class="grid gap-10 pt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-20"
            >
                {
                    team.map(member => (
                        <div class="space-y-5">
                            <img
                                src={member.image}
                                alt=""
                                class="w-full object-cover"
                            />
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-khand font-bold text-proline-red">
                                    {member.name}
                                </h4>
                                <p>{member.role}</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div> -->
        </section>
    </Content>
</Layout>
